{"id":36710,"date":"2025-06-26T14:20:30","date_gmt":"2025-06-26T07:20:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/?page_id=36710"},"modified":"2025-08-07T11:27:40","modified_gmt":"2025-08-07T04:27:40","slug":"camtech-ai-university-purpose-innovation-asia","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/camtech-ai-university-purpose-innovation-asia\/","title":{"rendered":"CamTech: AI University | Purpose. Innovation. Asia.\u200b"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"36710\" class=\"elementor elementor-36710\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-331c46c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"331c46c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d5d6e86 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d5d6e86\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e0452f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9e0452f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b2b87f5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"b2b87f5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7064b3e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7064b3e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">CamTech: AI University | Purpose. Innovation. Asia.\u200b<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e5e5ba elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"6e5e5ba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfe9802 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cfe9802\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u00a0<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">In an era defined by artificial intelligence, CamTech University emerges as a bold force for transformation \u2014 Cambodia\u2019s first AI-driven university and a trailblazer in the region. <\/span>At CamTech, AI is our foundation. We are the first in Cambodia to offer a complete academic pathway in <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/bp\/\">AI \u2014 from bachelor\u2019s<\/a><\/strong> to PhD \u2014 taught by dedicated, full-time faculty who combine deep technical expertise with a passion for teaching and discovery.<br \/>But we go further. <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">CamTech is the first university in Asia to offer a <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/masters-and-phd-programs\/\">PhD in Science, Technology, and Society (STS)<\/a><\/strong> \u2014 a groundbreaking program that prepares students to lead at the intersection of innovation, ethics, and social change. <\/span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">CamTech hosts three distinct but complementary initiatives that support education, <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/centers\/\">research<\/a><\/strong>, and values-based innovation in artificial intelligence. The <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/ai-forums\/\">AI Forum (AIF)<\/a><\/strong> is a pioneering platform founded in 2018 to promote critical dialogue on AI\u2019s societal impact. <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/center-for-buddhist-ai-ethics\/\">The Center for Buddhist AI Ethics<\/a><\/strong> brings ancient wisdom into conversation with cutting-edge technology. The AI Lab for Education is a hands-on, innovation-driven laboratory focused on applying AI to enhance learning and teaching.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-904cc7b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"904cc7b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-049b751 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"049b751\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ff0aba e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9ff0aba\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23911d7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"23911d7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f9175b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6f9175b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our research is intentionally interdisciplinary, exploring how AI intersects with:<\/p><ul><li>Ethics and Law<\/li><li>Education and Linguistics<\/li><li>Diplomacy and Global Security<\/li><li>Health and Well-being<\/li><\/ul><p>CamTech scholars are shaping global conversations \u2014 with invitations to speak at the <a href=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/prof-dr-sothy-khieng-invited-to-present-at-11th-nishan-forum-on-world-civilizations-in-qufu-china\/\"><strong>Nishan Forum on World Civilizations<\/strong><\/a>, the Pontifical Academy of Social Sciences, and other international platforms. <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">At CamTech, we believe the future of AI must be guided by wisdom, not just code. <\/span>We are building a new kind of university \u2014 one that inspires ethical leadership, regional innovation, and global impact. Join us. Lead the AI revolution \u2014 with vision, values, and purpose.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ba29e4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9ba29e4\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3593717 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3593717\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3a3f6e9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3a3f6e9\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0d821d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e0d821d\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1532f45 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1532f45\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62df2b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"62df2b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"426\" src=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Robot-Arm-with-NEO-1024x682.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-36891\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Robot-Arm-with-NEO-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Robot-Arm-with-NEO-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Robot-Arm-with-NEO-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp