dia to offer a complete academic pathway in AI \u2014 from bachelor\u2019s to PhD \u2014 taught by dedicated, full-time faculty who combine deep technical expertise with a passion for teaching and discovery.But we go further. CamTech is the first university in Asia to offer a PhD in Science, Technology, and Society (STS) \u2014 a groundbreaking program that prepares students to lead at the intersection of innovation, ethics, and social change. CamTech hosts three distinct but complementary initiatives that support education, research, and values-based innovation in artificial intelligence. The AI Forum (AIF) is a pioneering platform founded in 2018 to promote critical dialogue on AI\u2019s societal impact. The Center for Buddhist AI Ethics brings ancient wisdom into conversation with cutting-edge technology. The AI Lab for Education is a hands-on, innovation-driven laboratory focused on applying AI to enhance learning and teaching. Our research is intentionally interdisciplinary, exploring how AI intersects with: Ethics and Law Education and Linguistics Diplomacy and Global Security Health and Well-being CamTech scholars are shaping global conversations \u2014 with invitations to speak at the Nishan Forum on World Civilizations, the Pontifical Academy of Social Sciences, and other international platforms. At CamTech, we believe the future of AI must be guided by wisdom, not just code. We are building a new kind of university \u2014 one that inspires ethical leadership, regional innovation, and global impact. Join us. Lead the AI revolution \u2014 with vision, values, and purpose.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":7,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-36710","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry","post-no-thumbnail"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/36710","targetHints":{"